        "title": "Lauziu gaenghmei nun rui zingbang",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Lauziu gaenghmei nun rui zingbang,",
            "Nkhuan na dungbam khou,",
            "Poubaumei baanch’ra tei keina,",
            "Kaniu daeng tigaanlou.",
            "",
            "2. Kaniu pingbam khou Kamei rui",
            "“Ping riu” salou khuan e,",
            "“Neihla daihmei gaipui lat hei",
            "Ai phung guangpui tuang e.”",
            "",
            "3. “Nangniu khang David namdaih khou,",
            "David zeiriang khou rui,",
            "Kalloumei Pu Pouh, Khrista kiu",
            "Zaat guai khang puanlou the.”",
            "",
            "4. “Tingkau ngaana ta hou puni",
            "Maansei guanhna puanhmei,",
            "Pheinuaihna rui kaduap lana,",
            "Kiruai kuak khou zilou.”",
            "",
            "5. Seraph tei rui saatang pukhou",
            "Kauh baanch’ra kangdai rui",
            "Raguang tigun daihmei thuan na,",
            "Zaenggaipui lu suan e:",
            "",
            "6. “Tingkau thang Raguang himdai diu,",
            "Dih khou zaengmei nai diu;",
            "Kauh le dih chun-gai nailam diu,",
            "Tau rui thau tingsaenzaeng.”"
          ]
        }
      }
